# Planned Failure Scenario

**Target:** rhel01 (192.168.20.20), web service
**Purpose:** Exercise the full NOC incident lifecycle: detect, ticket, scope, troubleshoot, restore, validate, and write a root-cause analysis.

## Method
One of the following will be introduced (chosen in advance, recorded only in the incident record after resolution):
- Stop the web service (`systemctl stop httpd`)
- Block the service port with firewalld

## Expected detection
Monitoring alert on the failed service check.

## Success criteria
- Alert time recorded
- Incident ticket opened with scope and impact
- Root cause identified using standard tools (ping, ss, curl, systemctl, journalctl, firewall-cmd)
- Service restored and availability validated
- Detection time and recovery time recorded
- Root-cause analysis written